    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9359" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνοψία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>want of fish</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄψον</span>) <i>to eat with bread,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔφερον δεινῶς τὴν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					190.8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνοψίαν ὑποφέρειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.237f
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
