				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ μὴ βλέπειν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνοψοφίην</span> cod.).</div>
